{"id":6589,"date":"2022-04-26T13:02:28","date_gmt":"2022-04-26T20:02:28","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/?post_type=lesson&#038;p=6589"},"modified":"2023-08-21T08:35:43","modified_gmt":"2023-08-21T15:35:43","slug":"intro-to-codrone-mini","status":"publish","type":"lesson","link":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/lesson\/intro-to-codrone-mini\/","title":{"rendered":"0.1: Intro to CoDrone Mini"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"wpb-content-wrapper\"><p>[vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a2214296aa20\" name=\"6a2214296aa20\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 1<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Video Tutorial<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]The CoDrone Mini is a compact, intelligent, innovative, and (most importantly) flying learning platform for students of ALL ages![\/vc_column_text][vc_video link=&#8221;https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=AZwrEs6Ppg8&#8243;]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a2214296ab49\" name=\"6a2214296ab49\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 2<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>CoDrone Mini Kit Overview<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]Here&#8217;s a breakdown of what comes in your CoDrone Mini Kit:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">CoDrone Mini<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Remote Control<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">USB to MicroUSB<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Battery<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Battery Charging Cable<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">4 x Extra Propellers<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][vc_single_image image=&#8221;1657&#8243; img_size=&#8221;large&#8221; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a2214296abc8\" name=\"6a2214296abc8\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 3<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>CoDrone Mini Features<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]Here are the features of the CoDrone Mini:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Programmable RGB LED<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Programmable buzzer<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Gyroscope<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Accelerometer<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Barometer (air pressure, temperature, and height)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Compatible with Windows, Mac, and <\/span><b>most<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> Chromebooks<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Python and Block coding<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][vc_single_image image=&#8221;2198&#8243; img_size=&#8221;large&#8221; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a2214296ac2f\" name=\"6a2214296ac2f\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 4<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Safety Tips<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]Here are just a few safety tips to keep in mind when flying your CoDrone Mini!<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><b>Open Spaces<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Make sure you are flying your drones with as much space around you as possible<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><b>Tie your hair<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">For those with long hair keep a hair tie handy because CoDrone can get stuck!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><b>Watch your fingers!<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Always hold the drone from the guards, be alert, and never try to grab someone else\u2019s drone. You never know when it might take off!<\/span>[\/vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row]<\/p>\n<\/div>","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"[vc_row][vc_column] Step 5 Video Tutorial [vc_column_text]The CoDrone Mini is a compact, intelligent, innovative, and (most importantly) flying learning platform for students of ALL ages![\/vc_column_text][vc_video link=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=AZwrEs6Ppg8\"] [\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column] Step 6 CoDrone Mini&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/lesson\/intro-to-codrone-mini\/\">&hellip;<\/a>","protected":false},"featured_media":2426,"template":"","meta":{"_initial_content":"","_new_post":false,"_quiz_has_questions":false,"_lesson_complexity":"easy","_lesson_length":10,"_lesson_course":3473,"_lesson_preview":""},"lesson-category":[],"lesson-tag":[2174,2125,2177,2134],"class_list":["post-6589","lesson","type-lesson","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","lesson-tag-coding","lesson-tag-codrone-mini","lesson-tag-getting-started","lesson-tag-python","module-getting-started","post","odd"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/lessons\/6589","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/lessons"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/lesson"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/lessons\/6589\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":6595,"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/lessons\/6589\/revisions\/6595"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/a